WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.193 --> 01:37.373
=Episode 16=

01:40.207 --> 01:41.327
This bamboo scroll

01:41.767 --> 01:43.287
is a farewell letter I restored,

01:43.448 --> 01:45.808
written by a young soldier
to his mother.

01:47.327 --> 01:49.407
"The beacon fires of the border
have not yet died down.

01:49.927 --> 01:51.888
My father and brother
have all fallen on the battlefield.

01:52.368 --> 01:53.648
I fear I too

01:53.648 --> 01:54.847
will follow them.

01:55.567 --> 01:56.567
Mother, do not grieve.

01:57.567 --> 01:58.448
My spirit

01:59.088 --> 02:00.407
will forever guard this land.

02:01.168 --> 02:03.088
It will become the winds
along the border,

02:03.287 --> 02:04.127
year after year,

02:04.287 --> 02:05.648
by your side."

02:08.768 --> 02:09.968
Their experiences,

02:10.607 --> 02:11.648
and even their lives,

02:12.808 --> 02:14.447
will be buried by time.

02:15.847 --> 02:17.968
But future generations
will remember them

02:17.968 --> 02:18.968
through these words.

02:20.127 --> 02:20.847
Future generations

02:21.007 --> 02:21.968
seeing us today

02:22.328 --> 02:23.048
is the same as

02:23.208 --> 02:23.928
us today

02:24.248 --> 02:25.127
seeing the ancients.

02:25.567 --> 02:26.727
That is the meaning

02:27.248 --> 02:28.687
of writing and recording.

02:30.928 --> 02:33.007
The value of written words...

02:33.488 --> 02:34.528
If that's the case...

02:34.528 --> 02:35.847
doesn't depend on who writes them...

02:35.928 --> 02:38.208
even I can't claim
to be a true lover of books.

02:42.208 --> 02:42.928
Young Master.

02:43.727 --> 02:44.528
It's late.

02:45.447 --> 02:47.727
The Book of Songs
speaks of virtue in a gentle maiden.

02:48.368 --> 02:50.607
The Songs of Chu express deep feelings
through fragrant plants.

02:52.768 --> 02:54.768
Even Ananda in the Surangama Sutra

02:55.808 --> 02:57.928
could not escape the snare
of the maiden Matangi.

02:58.648 --> 03:00.127
It seems the snare of love is deep,

03:02.048 --> 03:03.727
inescapable for sage or mortal alike.

03:04.808 --> 03:05.607
But tell me,

03:06.167 --> 03:07.167
why would a man

03:08.808 --> 03:10.928
be drawn to a woman?

03:11.928 --> 03:12.928
Perhaps

03:13.847 --> 03:14.928
because she is beautiful?

03:18.648 --> 03:20.687
Are there not plenty of beautiful women
in this world?

03:23.007 --> 03:23.808
Then

03:24.768 --> 03:26.488
is it her gentle nature?

03:26.488 --> 03:28.328
Which maid in the household
isn't gentle?

03:29.687 --> 03:30.528
Because she is well-read?

03:32.328 --> 03:34.607
All the noble ladies I have known

03:35.048 --> 03:36.528
have been well-versed in the classics.

03:37.567 --> 03:38.447
But none of these

03:40.648 --> 03:41.928
can truly be called love.

03:43.248 --> 03:44.167
Could it be

03:45.928 --> 03:47.048
that she once saved you?

03:51.887 --> 03:53.167
If it were only to show gratitude,

03:54.488 --> 03:56.048
a thousand pieces of gold would suffice.

03:56.808 --> 03:57.928
It is because she is

03:58.847 --> 03:59.928
one of a kind.

04:01.048 --> 04:02.488
When calamity struck Huaying,

04:04.007 --> 04:05.528
she should have withered.

04:10.127 --> 04:10.968
Once,

04:13.727 --> 04:14.968
I loved the narcissus,

04:15.447 --> 04:16.487
not the magnolia.

04:17.607 --> 04:19.568
But now, the magnolia
has wandered to the Gobi,

04:20.847 --> 04:22.448
and grows more like a poplar.

04:23.328 --> 04:24.367
The fiercer the wind,

04:25.128 --> 04:26.128
the stronger it stands.

04:26.888 --> 04:27.768
And the narcissus?

04:29.088 --> 04:30.847
It got its wish
and entered the greenhouse,

04:31.927 --> 04:33.528
yet grows more like a reed,

04:34.128 --> 04:35.407
lost among the masses.

04:36.568 --> 04:37.208
Tell me.

04:39.568 --> 04:40.968
Did I choose wrong?

04:49.730 --> 04:51.883
(Zhao Residence)

04:56.448 --> 04:57.727
Please inform the Ninth Young Lady

04:58.487 --> 04:59.968
that regarding the old matters
in Huaying,

05:00.407 --> 05:01.047
today

05:01.607 --> 05:03.088
I have come to give her an explanation.

05:05.568 --> 05:07.088
Back then, I was arrogant and proud.

05:07.807 --> 05:09.607
I wronged you.

05:10.208 --> 05:11.128
All these years,

05:12.047 --> 05:13.328
whenever I think of it,

05:13.487 --> 05:14.648
my conscience has troubled me.

05:15.968 --> 05:17.807
Is it not too late, Mr. Yu,

05:19.328 --> 05:20.688
to be saying this now?

05:22.328 --> 05:23.607
Indeed, it is too late.

05:24.367 --> 05:25.688
But I came today

05:27.128 --> 05:28.847
precisely to put the past

05:29.727 --> 05:30.768
to rest.

05:44.847 --> 05:47.047
I have already signed
a written confession for you.

05:47.448 --> 05:48.888
It clears your name.

06:04.888 --> 06:06.088
Are you so confident

06:06.807 --> 06:08.328
that even with that confession,

06:10.088 --> 06:11.607
I cannot bring you down?

06:14.768 --> 06:15.968
If you insist on doing this,

06:17.328 --> 06:18.607
I have nothing to say.

06:19.448 --> 06:20.247
It's just that

06:21.568 --> 06:23.328
more than empty fame,

06:25.008 --> 06:26.247
what I truly value

06:26.727 --> 06:28.167
is not making an enemy of you.

06:57.607 --> 06:58.688
(Declarant)

06:58.768 --> 06:59.568
(Yu Jingxiu)

07:00.247 --> 07:02.208
(intended to break the engagement
with Fu Tingyun)

07:02.210 --> 07:03.083
(and framed her for infidelity.)

07:03.088 --> 07:05.008
(Yu Jingxiu, Secret Letter)
(He gave Zuo a wicked scheme,)

07:05.607 --> 07:06.208
(stating)

07:06.607 --> 07:08.088
(if her brother Zuo Junjie)

07:08.167 --> 07:09.607
(Written Confession)
(falsely accused Fu of lost virtue)

07:10.208 --> 07:11.208
(and forced the engagement to end,)

07:12.008 --> 07:14.008
(he'd secure her brother
a future in office.)

07:15.167 --> 07:16.287
(Lest there be no proof later,)

07:17.088 --> 07:18.487
(Declarant: Yu Jingxiu)
(this confession is thus made.)

07:19.927 --> 07:20.847
(Yu Jingxiu)

07:32.487 --> 07:33.688
Is this over just like that?

07:34.927 --> 07:35.528
Miss Xie.

07:37.328 --> 07:38.407
This dress

07:38.927 --> 07:40.648
must have been paid for by that Yu.

07:40.968 --> 07:42.568
Last time you bandaged his wound,

07:42.568 --> 07:43.287
yours got torn.

07:43.528 --> 07:44.768
Look at the pattern and style.

07:44.768 --> 07:45.568
He bought an exact match.

07:46.807 --> 07:47.727
And he left this too.

07:52.648 --> 07:54.688
(The eastern chamber's swing
sways high in the wind.)

07:55.128 --> 07:57.287
(Summer's end,
yet joy still feels too brief.)

07:57.321 --> 07:59.182
(The east chamber)

08:00.688 --> 08:02.247
A pedantic scholar's trick.

08:04.208 --> 08:04.888
Young Master.

08:05.167 --> 08:06.128
The Ninth Young Lady

08:06.328 --> 08:07.487
sent the things back.

08:12.161 --> 08:12.627
(Zhao Residence)

08:12.648 --> 08:13.167
Young Master.

08:20.487 --> 08:21.287
Mr. Yu.

08:21.607 --> 08:22.807
My young lady said

08:23.247 --> 08:24.328
she will not see you again.

08:24.648 --> 08:25.648
Please go back.

08:26.768 --> 08:28.727
What if I insist on opening this door?

08:34.247 --> 08:35.127
Mr. Zhao, you're back.

08:41.887 --> 08:43.928
(She was born a lady of a noble house.)

08:44.688 --> 08:46.328
(Now she wears rough clothes
and eats plain food.)

08:47.007 --> 08:47.767
(Why)

08:48.847 --> 08:50.288
(would you let a jewel like her
be buried in the dust?)

08:54.767 --> 08:55.527
You're back.

09:12.007 --> 09:12.968
Suppose...

09:15.568 --> 09:16.968
Just suppose.

09:19.527 --> 09:21.247
If Fan and Zuo Junjie

09:22.408 --> 09:24.527
hadn't interfered back in Huaying,

09:25.808 --> 09:27.647
with his talent and virtue,

09:28.088 --> 09:29.367
and you in the prime of your youth,

09:29.847 --> 09:31.808
might you have been drawn to each other?

09:33.527 --> 09:35.007
Would you have been a perfect match?

09:40.168 --> 09:41.328
Why would you think that?

09:45.568 --> 09:47.088
He signed the written confession.

09:49.048 --> 09:50.367
That counts as seeing the error
of his ways.

09:54.727 --> 09:56.487
I don't think he feels guilty at all.

09:58.808 --> 10:00.448
Then what trick do you think
he's playing?

10:03.127 --> 10:03.928
Probably

10:06.247 --> 10:07.568
retreating in order to advance.

10:09.127 --> 10:10.527
Who knows what he'll do next?

10:11.168 --> 10:11.968
In any case,

10:12.168 --> 10:13.367
we need to stay on guard.

10:55.408 --> 10:56.048
Look.

10:58.048 --> 10:59.408
That's the Big Dipper.

11:00.928 --> 11:03.808
See how those seven stars together

11:03.887 --> 11:05.208
really do look like a ladle.

11:09.408 --> 11:10.847
The ancients called it

11:11.127 --> 11:12.727
Xuanji Yuheng.

11:14.127 --> 11:15.408
When the handle points east,

11:15.767 --> 11:17.328
spring has come.

11:18.448 --> 11:19.767
When the handle points west,

11:20.007 --> 11:21.527
autumn arrives.

11:35.408 --> 11:37.088
Tonight's breeze

11:37.808 --> 11:38.808
feels nice.

11:45.968 --> 11:46.887
Very cool.

11:48.356 --> 11:55.170
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye
will fill my eyes with tears♪

11:56.383 --> 12:02.983
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

12:03.607 --> 12:07.161
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

12:07.547 --> 12:11.590
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

12:12.083 --> 12:17.423
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

12:17.568 --> 12:18.288
(Advisory Hall)
My Lords,

12:18.808 --> 12:19.568
Ganlin Town

12:19.647 --> 12:21.887
has a tradition
of the Yellow River Lantern Formation.

12:22.328 --> 12:23.288
As the season approaches,

12:23.367 --> 12:24.688
we should use this grand event

12:25.048 --> 12:26.487
to boost the morale
of both soldiers and civilians.

12:27.688 --> 12:28.487
By custom,

12:29.048 --> 12:30.007
the winner of the lantern formation

12:30.127 --> 12:31.247
may ascend the city wall

12:31.328 --> 12:32.448
to light the lanterns and offer prayers.

12:33.847 --> 12:36.007
Now that the women's hall is thriving,

12:36.487 --> 12:37.448
we might bend the rules

12:37.887 --> 12:38.607
and select

12:39.007 --> 12:40.727
a virtuous and talented woman.

12:41.328 --> 12:43.247
Young Lord Yu, you've seen a lot.

12:43.247 --> 12:44.007
May I ask

12:44.328 --> 12:45.647
what you would suggest?

12:46.208 --> 12:47.007
In my view,

12:47.968 --> 12:49.847
Ms. Xie would be most suitable.

12:52.048 --> 12:53.007
However,

12:53.007 --> 12:54.127
this lantern festival

12:54.127 --> 12:55.527
requires a considerable sum.

12:55.688 --> 12:57.688
I fear it may be beyond our means.

12:58.288 --> 12:59.127
I...

12:59.647 --> 13:00.607
Commander Wang.

13:01.168 --> 13:02.847
It's only a lantern festival.

13:02.928 --> 13:04.288
How much could it possibly cost?

13:05.007 --> 13:06.408
Indeed, Commander Wang.

13:06.928 --> 13:08.168
Sharing joy with the people

13:08.168 --> 13:09.247
is also good governance.

13:09.487 --> 13:10.448
Don't you agree?

13:17.448 --> 13:18.007
I take my leave.

13:18.007 --> 13:18.688
I take my leave.

13:22.288 --> 13:23.688
Commander Wang, please stay.

13:26.288 --> 13:27.607
If I may be so bold,

13:28.487 --> 13:29.647
the match between a scholar
and a lady

13:30.007 --> 13:32.847
has always been beloved by the people.

13:33.168 --> 13:35.568
So this time, we must ensure Ms. Xie

13:36.007 --> 13:37.328
and the winner of the lantern formation

13:37.328 --> 13:38.568
ascend the stage together.

13:38.847 --> 13:41.007
This will surely give Ganlin Town

13:41.168 --> 13:42.408
a story for the ages.

13:48.328 --> 13:50.208
I heard you proposed to Commander Wang

13:50.208 --> 13:52.168
that a market be set up
during the Lantern Festival,

13:53.007 --> 13:54.408
with booth rentals

13:54.408 --> 13:55.767
covering the costs.

13:57.247 --> 13:59.007
If you pull this off,

13:59.127 --> 14:00.328
year after year,

14:00.607 --> 14:02.847
this tradition can carry on.

14:03.367 --> 14:04.328
Gradually,

14:04.527 --> 14:06.727
Ganlin Town
will become a commercial hub.

14:07.328 --> 14:08.607
That would be real political merit

14:08.808 --> 14:09.727
for Commander Wang,

14:10.168 --> 14:11.847
and for you as well.

14:13.127 --> 14:15.688
Who says you can only fight fire
with fire in the military?

14:17.847 --> 14:18.688
Mr. Zhao,

14:19.767 --> 14:21.367
with that flexibility,

14:21.727 --> 14:23.168
you're sure to build a bright future.

14:25.288 --> 14:26.088
When the time comes,

14:26.328 --> 14:28.127
I will ascend the tower to cheer you on.

14:28.847 --> 14:29.607
Do you

14:30.328 --> 14:31.767
know what ascending the tower entails?

14:32.568 --> 14:33.288
I do.

14:33.527 --> 14:34.408
I hear

14:34.408 --> 14:35.647
they'll have me hold the staff
and light the lantern.

14:35.887 --> 14:36.727
Then...

14:42.808 --> 14:43.568
Do you want to go?

14:43.767 --> 14:45.168
They say this year,

14:45.168 --> 14:46.247
as a special exception for me,

14:46.928 --> 14:48.727
it's meant
to encourage women's education.

14:48.928 --> 14:50.088
How could I refuse?

15:00.288 --> 15:01.048
Mr. Zhao,

15:01.048 --> 15:02.247
aren't you going to stop her?

15:02.607 --> 15:04.048
Yu Jingxiu is determined to win.

15:04.208 --> 15:05.448
If he lights the lantern with her

15:05.448 --> 15:06.767
in front of everyone,

15:06.767 --> 15:07.127
then...

15:07.568 --> 15:08.688
He's determined to win.

15:08.808 --> 15:09.568
Does that mean he will?

15:11.779 --> 15:13.999
(Chiyu Post Station)

15:14.048 --> 15:15.568
Young Master, I don't recall you
putting this much effort in,

15:16.007 --> 15:17.408
even back in the imperial exams.

15:17.647 --> 15:19.727
The imperial exams,
of course, I had to fight for.

15:20.928 --> 15:21.887
But this lantern formation,

15:23.127 --> 15:24.607
I cannot fall behind in that either.

15:43.408 --> 15:44.127
Mr. Zhao.

15:45.847 --> 15:47.007
Go. Hurry up!

15:47.408 --> 15:48.048
Let's go.

15:52.847 --> 15:53.688
What are you thinking about?

15:57.727 --> 15:58.767
In our future,

16:02.968 --> 16:04.127
will we be married?

16:11.647 --> 16:12.928
Some couples in this world

16:14.568 --> 16:15.647
share a bed but not a heart,

16:17.208 --> 16:18.487
yet play the part in public.

16:20.727 --> 16:22.007
Some treat each other with respect,

16:23.527 --> 16:24.767
yet remain worlds apart.

16:27.048 --> 16:28.208
Some weather the storms together,

16:30.168 --> 16:31.448
yet still lose to time.

16:34.527 --> 16:35.808
Some have run their course,

16:39.968 --> 16:41.247
yet are bound together all the same.

16:45.847 --> 16:46.527
Tingyun.

16:48.007 --> 16:48.968
I want to ask you something.

16:51.288 --> 16:52.647
When we're married someday...

16:52.723 --> 16:56.330
♪Let this fleeting world carry me
through a life adrift♪

16:56.367 --> 16:57.808
what kind of couple
do you hope we'll be?

16:58.903 --> 17:03.760
♪With wit and strategy,
I enter this game without regret♪

17:05.350 --> 17:08.057
♪Though each move is forced upon me♪

17:08.130 --> 17:12.530
♪May it buy the world
one moment's peace from the storm♪

17:12.837 --> 17:17.964
♪I crave no clarity
from outside my soul♪

17:19.323 --> 17:23.480
♪I crave no clarity♪

17:24.518 --> 17:26.879
♪from outside my soul♪

17:38.567 --> 17:39.487
Ladies and gentlemen, please.

17:39.888 --> 17:41.648
This year's
Yellow River Lantern Formation

17:41.888 --> 17:42.848
is set according to the Eight Trigrams,

17:42.928 --> 17:44.047
with a gate for each direction.

17:44.448 --> 17:45.168
Enter through the Life Gate,

17:45.247 --> 17:46.087
exit through the Rest Gate.

17:46.327 --> 17:47.527
If you mistakenly
step into the Death Gate,

17:47.648 --> 17:48.888
the formation will shift.

17:49.767 --> 17:50.888
Whoever emerges first

17:51.208 --> 17:52.448
will be the victor.

17:52.767 --> 17:53.688
Whether you can break it

17:54.047 --> 17:55.527
depends on your skill.

17:56.327 --> 17:57.567
With such a grand spectacle,

17:57.807 --> 17:58.807
Young Lord Yu,

17:59.527 --> 18:00.608
would you care to enter

18:00.727 --> 18:01.928
and show us what you've got?

18:02.247 --> 18:04.888
Young Lord Yu is a civil official
from the capital.

18:05.087 --> 18:06.408
He is of high status.

18:06.688 --> 18:08.888
Down there are all our soldiers.

18:08.888 --> 18:09.608
They are rough and reckless.

18:09.608 --> 18:10.888
If anything goes wrong,

18:10.888 --> 18:12.608
I cannot bear the responsibility.

18:12.727 --> 18:13.487
Commander Wang,

18:15.287 --> 18:16.848
this formation is based
on the Eight Trigrams.

18:16.848 --> 18:18.247
Though I am a civil official,

18:18.247 --> 18:19.688
I have studied
the Book of Changes since childhood.

18:19.848 --> 18:21.727
I am no stranger
to the Eight Trigrams formation.

18:22.448 --> 18:24.767
Since you're so inclined,

18:25.087 --> 18:26.608
I will not stand in your way.

19:47.727 --> 19:48.767
Something is definitely off.

19:49.688 --> 19:50.648
Something is wrong.

19:51.168 --> 19:51.928
Look at him.

19:52.047 --> 19:53.527
He doesn't even need
to check directions.

19:53.688 --> 19:54.848
He walks through these crossroads

19:54.848 --> 19:56.727
like he's strolling in his own backyard.

19:56.928 --> 19:57.648
Could it be

19:57.727 --> 19:58.767
he secretly studied the formation

19:59.208 --> 20:00.368
and knows all the tricks?

20:02.767 --> 20:03.767
(Go into the formation)

20:03.767 --> 20:05.168
(to set up some traps)

20:05.408 --> 20:07.327
(And place some of our own men inside.)

20:07.327 --> 20:08.487
(No matter what,)

20:08.688 --> 20:09.567
(make sure)

20:09.567 --> 20:11.128
(Young Master Yu)

20:11.247 --> 20:12.727
(emerges first.)

20:13.448 --> 20:14.168
That's not fair.

20:14.487 --> 20:15.608
Having a powerful father

20:15.608 --> 20:17.007
means he can ignore the rules?

20:17.007 --> 20:17.888
He must be beaten.

20:17.888 --> 20:19.168
This can't go on.

20:20.648 --> 20:21.727
The Rest Gate is hard to find.

20:21.727 --> 20:22.688
Do you know where the Death Gate is?

20:22.688 --> 20:23.527
Success is uncertain,

20:23.807 --> 20:25.087
but I've had plenty of

20:25.287 --> 20:26.007
experience with failure.

20:26.007 --> 20:26.287
Let's go.

20:30.567 --> 20:32.368
I thought he had some skill.

20:32.368 --> 20:33.527
But now it seems

20:34.087 --> 20:35.087
he's nothing special.

20:36.527 --> 20:37.688
(We hope you will go easy on us)

20:37.767 --> 20:39.648
(Lantern Formation)
(in the performance review.)

20:48.208 --> 20:48.727
Mr. Zhao.

20:48.727 --> 20:49.368
(Death)
Death Gate.

21:00.743 --> 21:02.003
(Death)

21:12.097 --> 21:13.417
(Death)

21:41.007 --> 21:42.688
Too easy!

21:43.527 --> 21:44.767
Is it that your garrison

21:45.007 --> 21:46.408
has been slacking off?

21:46.608 --> 21:48.408
Is this all you've got?

21:50.648 --> 21:51.928
Nonsense!

21:52.448 --> 21:54.487
I deliberately went easy on you.

21:54.487 --> 21:55.968
And now you're putting on airs?

21:56.168 --> 21:56.807
Fine.

21:57.007 --> 21:57.688
Bring it on!

21:58.047 --> 21:58.767
Change the formation!

22:10.208 --> 22:10.888
Mr. Zhao.

22:11.208 --> 22:12.807
Yu Jingxiu is truly stumped.

22:29.848 --> 22:31.047
(When the handle points east,)

22:31.408 --> 22:33.007
(spring has come.)

22:33.327 --> 22:34.688
(When the handle points west,)

22:34.928 --> 22:36.448
(autumn arrives.)

22:37.567 --> 22:38.327
I've got an idea.

22:41.727 --> 22:42.408
Sanniang.

22:42.807 --> 22:43.807
Go and find out

22:43.807 --> 22:44.807
what's really going on.

22:44.807 --> 22:45.487
Alright.

22:54.047 --> 22:55.128
(I don't know much about formations,)

22:55.448 --> 22:56.727
(but I do know a bit
about reading the stars.)

22:56.968 --> 22:57.567
(This central pole)

22:57.648 --> 22:58.688
(is the heart of the formation.)

22:59.168 --> 23:00.688
(According to the ancient design
of the Yellow River Formation,)

23:00.888 --> 23:02.087
(it must symbolize the North Star.)

23:02.408 --> 23:03.047
(At the Autumnal Equinox,)

23:03.168 --> 23:04.087
(the handle points west.)

23:04.087 --> 23:05.688
(So my left is west,
and my right is east.)

23:05.848 --> 23:07.767
(So this formation hides deadly traps.)

23:08.888 --> 23:09.727
(The Nine Stars of the Big Dipper.)

23:09.888 --> 23:10.888
(Seven visible, two hidden.)

23:11.168 --> 23:12.128
(The central pole marks the core.)

23:12.128 --> 23:13.168
(Alkaid points to the Rest Gate.)

23:13.608 --> 23:14.648
(And those two hidden stars)

23:14.928 --> 23:16.247
(are the true way out.)

23:16.807 --> 23:18.688
(The left assistant star aligns
with the Wei constellation.)

23:19.168 --> 23:20.928
(The right assistant aligns
with the Xu constellation.)

23:21.527 --> 23:22.928
(Where their paths cross)

23:23.888 --> 23:24.848
(is the Rest Gate.)

23:48.247 --> 23:49.007
Miss Xie.

23:50.408 --> 23:51.448
Miss Xie, I...

23:52.128 --> 23:53.168
There's something

23:53.807 --> 23:55.128
I've been thinking about,

23:55.487 --> 23:57.247
and I feel I should tell you.

23:57.727 --> 23:59.368
Today, the one
who wins the lantern formation

24:00.968 --> 24:02.448
will be the one to ascend the tower

24:03.168 --> 24:04.608
and light the lantern with you.

24:10.928 --> 24:12.648
So their proposal
to have me light the lantern

24:13.128 --> 24:14.888
was never about promoting
the women's hall.

24:16.767 --> 24:18.448
It was to please Yu Jingxiu.

24:20.448 --> 24:21.648
Does Mr. Zhao know about this?

24:22.648 --> 24:23.608
Mr. Zhao said

24:24.168 --> 24:25.327
he will definitely win.

24:25.327 --> 24:26.287
He told you to wait for him.

24:56.128 --> 24:57.047
Is that Mr. Zhao?

25:13.168 --> 25:14.168
It's Mr. Zhao.

25:15.608 --> 25:16.567
It really is Mr. Zhao.

25:17.087 --> 25:17.888
I announce

25:17.888 --> 25:19.128
the winner is Zhao Ling.

25:19.128 --> 25:19.767
Good!

25:19.767 --> 25:24.208
Good!

25:51.807 --> 25:52.527
Mr. Zhao.

25:56.807 --> 25:57.608
Mr. Zhao.

26:04.688 --> 26:07.047
Good!

26:07.047 --> 26:07.648
How are you feeling?

26:08.168 --> 26:09.208
Are you hurt anywhere?

26:09.208 --> 26:10.047
Are you alright?

26:37.208 --> 26:38.888
I'm just glad you're okay.

26:44.608 --> 26:46.368
Good!

26:57.047 --> 26:58.648
Good!

27:05.848 --> 27:07.807
A match made in heaven.

27:08.208 --> 27:09.128
If only I could

27:09.128 --> 27:11.128
have a man like Mr. Zhao,

27:11.128 --> 27:12.327
how wonderful that would be.

27:13.247 --> 27:14.648
Only Ms. Xie

27:14.648 --> 27:16.408
deserves such a fine man.

27:16.928 --> 27:18.047
A perfect union!

27:18.047 --> 27:19.448
A perfect union!

27:19.448 --> 27:26.007
Good!

27:32.007 --> 27:32.688
Miss Xie.

28:06.727 --> 28:12.297
Good!

28:12.297 --> 28:17.868
Good!

28:17.868 --> 28:23.439
Good!

28:23.439 --> 28:29.007
Good!

28:52.807 --> 28:53.767
What if

28:54.368 --> 28:55.648
you hadn't broken the formation,

28:56.727 --> 28:58.968
and Yu Jingxiu had reached the end
before you?

29:00.087 --> 29:01.688
If I had lit the lantern with him

29:01.968 --> 29:03.168
and enjoyed the view together,

29:04.807 --> 29:06.527
would that have been a tale to tell?

29:12.247 --> 29:13.448
Do you care about me?

29:16.408 --> 29:17.408
I didn't tell you

29:20.007 --> 29:21.567
because
I didn't want to spoil your mood.

29:21.848 --> 29:23.527
For the sake of my whim,

29:24.247 --> 29:25.208
did you just go ahead

29:25.208 --> 29:27.047
and do everything all by yourself?

29:27.247 --> 29:28.767
If you had been badly hurt

29:28.968 --> 29:30.047
while breaking the formation,

29:30.247 --> 29:31.807
do you think I wouldn't feel guilty?

29:32.247 --> 29:33.888
If Yu Jingxiu had used every trick

29:33.888 --> 29:34.767
and won the formation,

29:35.247 --> 29:37.247
and rumors about us started to spread,

29:38.087 --> 29:39.648
do you think I wouldn't be humiliated?

29:44.567 --> 29:45.327
I'm sorry.

29:51.368 --> 29:52.767
I'm the one who should be sorry.

29:55.368 --> 29:58.408
You asked me before
what kind of couple I wanted us to be.

29:59.608 --> 30:00.608
Just now,

30:00.928 --> 30:01.968
I figured it out.

30:03.567 --> 30:05.327
I didn't make myself clear.

30:07.047 --> 30:08.807
I want to pledge my life to you,

30:10.368 --> 30:12.567
not just to find a suitable partner

30:12.567 --> 30:13.567
to walk the road to splendor together.

30:14.688 --> 30:16.448
I also want to find someone
I truly love,

30:17.208 --> 30:18.408
to quietly watch our days bloom.

30:21.888 --> 30:24.128
You've carried my ideals and my dignity.

30:25.208 --> 30:26.128
Yet you have never

30:26.128 --> 30:27.727
asked anything of me.

30:29.327 --> 30:29.968
Mr. Zhao,

30:30.567 --> 30:32.087
I don't just want someone

30:32.087 --> 30:33.327
to run a household with.

30:35.807 --> 30:37.287
I want to cherish you

30:38.848 --> 30:39.648
and love you.

30:42.087 --> 30:42.727
Zhao Ling,

30:44.608 --> 30:46.327
are we in love with each other?

30:46.375 --> 30:51.652
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

30:58.247 --> 30:59.807
(Mr. Zhao, will you marry me?)

31:02.208 --> 31:03.087
(What if)

31:03.888 --> 31:05.688
(we got married here in Ganlin Town?)

31:08.527 --> 31:09.608
Close your eyes.

31:10.116 --> 31:16.869
♪I turn away, afraid
no one will ever come home to me again♪

31:18.019 --> 31:24.413
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

31:25.239 --> 31:28.546
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

31:29.214 --> 31:33.320
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

31:33.821 --> 31:38.968
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

32:08.128 --> 32:10.168
Did I ever tell you to harm Zhao Ling?

32:10.968 --> 32:11.968
It's my fault.

32:12.767 --> 32:13.968
I should not have acted on my own.

32:15.928 --> 32:17.247
Since it's already done,

32:18.807 --> 32:19.727
then why

32:21.087 --> 32:22.807
not make it permanent?

32:24.888 --> 32:26.848
Please enlighten me, Young Lord Yu.

32:27.807 --> 32:29.208
If I want to have her,

32:31.527 --> 32:33.848
what good is it to just wound Zhao Ling?

32:35.968 --> 32:37.727
You need Zhao Ling dead.

32:39.408 --> 32:40.408
Sun Desheng.

32:40.767 --> 32:41.168
Yes.

32:41.688 --> 32:43.408
For capturing six warhorses,

32:44.327 --> 32:45.567
you'll be made a banner commander.

32:45.888 --> 32:46.567
Thank you, Commander.

32:49.688 --> 32:51.168
And finally,

32:58.007 --> 32:59.928
the post of garrison commander

32:59.928 --> 33:01.567
has been reviewed by the Ministry of War

33:03.648 --> 33:05.087
and will still be held by Mo Yi.

33:13.608 --> 33:14.448
Thank you, Commander.

33:15.608 --> 33:17.608
How many times must I say this?

33:17.767 --> 33:19.247
We are not forgetting your merits.

33:20.007 --> 33:21.208
But the court

33:21.208 --> 33:22.888
has its own considerations.

33:23.408 --> 33:24.527
Wait a few more days,

33:24.527 --> 33:25.487
and the rewards will come.

33:25.767 --> 33:26.408
Commander,

33:27.168 --> 33:29.487
you only come once
every five or six years.

33:29.727 --> 33:31.128
You want us to wait?

33:31.527 --> 33:33.007
Are we supposed to wait
five or six years?

33:35.128 --> 33:37.168
You may be low-ranking,
but your temper is anything but.

33:38.448 --> 33:39.688
You new recruits

33:39.688 --> 33:41.047
are all quite capable, aren't you?

33:41.208 --> 33:42.208
If you're so capable,

33:42.208 --> 33:43.648
why are you in such a hurry?

33:44.128 --> 33:45.767
You're not like Lu Dahu.

33:45.767 --> 33:46.888
Not destined for an early grave.

33:47.688 --> 33:48.087
Oh, right.

33:48.567 --> 33:49.608
He did have one

33:49.608 --> 33:51.327
major merit that was never recorded.

33:52.487 --> 33:53.608
So eager for promotion?

33:54.688 --> 33:56.087
Then follow his lead.

33:56.087 --> 33:57.888
Go earn yourself a big merit
and show us.

33:58.608 --> 33:59.287
Enough.

33:59.688 --> 34:00.888
Do you want to hit me?

34:09.368 --> 34:10.928
That deputy battalion commander post
is gone?

34:11.207 --> 34:12.607
All the merits our brothers fought for

34:12.607 --> 34:13.527
with our lives,

34:14.167 --> 34:15.167
now they go to someone else.

34:15.607 --> 34:16.728
It's infuriating.

34:17.087 --> 34:19.288
We owe this all to Commander Wang's
wisdom and integrity.

34:37.903 --> 34:40.723
(Mo Residence)

34:43.087 --> 34:43.928
Brothers,

34:45.167 --> 34:46.288
drink up.

34:46.288 --> 34:47.448
There's plenty of wine.

34:47.567 --> 34:49.328
Cheers!

34:49.328 --> 34:51.248
- Commander Wang.
- (Congratulations, General Mo.)

34:51.808 --> 34:53.527
Congratulations!

34:53.607 --> 34:54.207
Everyone,

34:55.448 --> 34:56.248
today,

34:56.567 --> 34:58.728
my husband
has been restored to his post.

34:59.487 --> 35:00.768
So all you brothers,

35:00.768 --> 35:01.968
eat and drink to your hearts' content.

35:02.248 --> 35:03.888
There's plenty of wine and mutton.

35:03.888 --> 35:04.647
Great!

35:04.647 --> 35:05.408
Look at that.

35:05.408 --> 35:07.567
General Mo is finally
holding his head high.

35:07.808 --> 35:09.167
But what about the Zhao family?

35:09.167 --> 35:10.888
Mr. Zhao was stripped
of his military merits.

35:11.007 --> 35:13.007
Miss Xie must be feeling bad inside.

35:14.368 --> 35:15.888
It's always the same.

35:15.888 --> 35:17.888
Some celebrate while others grieve.

35:18.127 --> 35:20.087
Otherwise, look at Miss Xie.

35:20.408 --> 35:21.408
She, of all people,

35:21.408 --> 35:22.888
knows how to read the room.

35:23.647 --> 35:24.288
Today,

35:24.328 --> 35:25.448
why didn't she show up?

35:34.527 --> 35:35.328
Ninth Young Lady.

35:38.087 --> 35:38.647
Please sit.

35:40.487 --> 35:42.167
Please be brief, Lord Yu.

35:42.567 --> 35:44.007
I have another banquet
to attend shortly.

35:47.167 --> 35:48.527
Company Commander Zhao has been wronged.

35:49.167 --> 35:50.408
I wish to help.

35:51.047 --> 35:52.167
You need not be on guard,
Ninth Young Lady.

35:53.288 --> 35:54.768
Back then, for my own selfish gain,

35:55.527 --> 35:56.768
I ruined your reputation,

35:57.207 --> 35:58.647
and thus altered your fate.

35:59.127 --> 36:00.087
Now, looking back,

36:00.928 --> 36:01.888
I am filled with regret.

36:02.728 --> 36:03.328
I only wish

36:04.527 --> 36:05.408
to make amends.

36:05.527 --> 36:06.127
No need.

36:08.127 --> 36:09.687
Losing the match with the Yu family

36:10.728 --> 36:11.928
was a misfortune back then,

36:12.408 --> 36:14.248
but now I see it as a blessing.

36:16.567 --> 36:19.167
I have decided to marry Mr. Zhao
once we return to the capital.

36:19.888 --> 36:20.527
From now on,

36:20.928 --> 36:23.167
I hope you and I
will go our separate ways.

36:23.888 --> 36:25.248
Do not disturb me again.

36:26.127 --> 36:27.527
Why are you so cold, Ninth Young Lady?

36:28.928 --> 36:29.567
In all my life,

36:30.728 --> 36:32.288
I have never bowed to anyone.

36:32.288 --> 36:32.928
Never bent my knee.

36:34.368 --> 36:35.167
All I ask is

36:36.728 --> 36:37.968
that you turn and look at me.

36:39.207 --> 36:40.248
Hear me out.

36:40.768 --> 36:42.167
Why are you always so unmoved?

36:43.087 --> 36:44.848
How could Zhao Ling
ever understand your talent?

36:46.968 --> 36:48.687
I only want to be your kindred spirit.

36:51.047 --> 36:52.127
Is it too much to ask

36:52.848 --> 36:53.687
that someone understand me?

36:57.527 --> 36:58.687
I was framed.

36:59.968 --> 37:00.968
My reputation was ruined.

37:02.368 --> 37:03.607
I was nearly poisoned

37:03.607 --> 37:04.607
to death in Biyun Nunnery.

37:05.888 --> 37:07.288
You destroyed my future,

37:08.047 --> 37:09.888
yet you think a simple apology

37:09.888 --> 37:10.888
would earn my forgiveness?

37:11.207 --> 37:12.607
And then I would see you again

37:12.607 --> 37:13.968
as an honorable and virtuous man?

37:15.288 --> 37:15.928
Lord Yu,

37:17.127 --> 37:19.127
why does forgiveness
come so cheap for you?

37:19.928 --> 37:21.248
Is it because
you come from a noble family,

37:21.248 --> 37:22.728
born to stand above the rest?

37:25.248 --> 37:26.928
They say a prodigal's return
is worth more than gold.

37:27.567 --> 37:29.768
But if a beggar or a bandit
were to turn over a new leaf,

37:30.248 --> 37:31.888
would it be worth just as much?

37:33.368 --> 37:34.928
So it's not that I'm unforgiving,

37:35.728 --> 37:37.687
clinging to one person's past wrongs.

37:38.888 --> 37:40.047
It is you, Lord Yu,

37:40.207 --> 37:42.167
who has never understood
the heart of the matter.

37:44.087 --> 37:45.728
You were born into privilege.

37:46.607 --> 37:48.448
So what you consider precious,

37:49.888 --> 37:51.647
your affection, your dignity,

37:52.888 --> 37:54.368
you offer them to me as a kindness.

37:55.007 --> 37:55.808
But I do not find

37:55.808 --> 37:57.087
those things precious at all.

38:07.167 --> 38:08.448
Why are you hiding in here?

38:09.248 --> 38:10.007
Come on.

38:10.448 --> 38:11.527
Your colleagues are all here.

38:12.288 --> 38:14.087
Quite a few brothers are already drunk.

38:16.288 --> 38:17.968
I don't deserve

38:17.968 --> 38:19.487
this reinstatement.

38:20.167 --> 38:21.207
I've let Zhao down,

38:21.207 --> 38:22.127
and Miss Xie, too.

38:22.448 --> 38:22.968
And you?

38:22.968 --> 38:24.087
You're out there throwing a big party.

38:24.087 --> 38:25.167
How can I show my face?

38:26.567 --> 38:28.047
You want to be true to your brothers?

38:28.647 --> 38:30.127
Then what about your family?

38:30.848 --> 38:32.087
Three children at home,

38:32.087 --> 38:33.167
three mouths

38:33.728 --> 38:34.647
to feed,

38:34.647 --> 38:36.127
all depending on your pay.

38:36.288 --> 38:36.728
Fine.

38:37.368 --> 38:38.248
If you've got the spine,

38:38.328 --> 38:39.087
go ahead

38:39.487 --> 38:40.808
and tell Commander Wang

38:40.808 --> 38:41.968
to take back your merits,

38:41.968 --> 38:43.127
start all over from scratch.

38:43.607 --> 38:44.808
Let's see then

38:44.888 --> 38:46.248
where you'll find the provisions

38:46.248 --> 38:47.408
to feed these children.

38:47.408 --> 38:49.408
Why do you always go on

38:49.408 --> 38:51.047
about merits and pay?

38:51.848 --> 38:54.007
Have I ever shortchanged you
on food or clothing?

38:54.687 --> 38:56.248
Without that pay, without those merits,

38:56.248 --> 38:56.647
what then?

38:56.647 --> 38:57.728
Would our family starve?

38:59.047 --> 38:59.768
Our eldest

39:00.448 --> 39:01.408
is a girl.

39:04.248 --> 39:05.647
Her prospects

39:05.808 --> 39:07.848
all depend on your rank.

39:08.728 --> 39:09.368
The second one

39:09.728 --> 39:11.007
has just started his schooling.

39:11.487 --> 39:14.888
Who knows if he's cut out for the books?

39:16.087 --> 39:16.647
The third...

39:18.328 --> 39:19.408
The third...

39:19.607 --> 39:21.768
Why are you crying?

39:23.127 --> 39:23.808
Here, wipe your face.

39:24.007 --> 39:24.728
Stop crying.

39:26.567 --> 39:27.888
Stop crying.

39:27.888 --> 39:28.607
Wipe your face.

39:30.408 --> 39:30.808
Come.

39:33.087 --> 39:33.768
So stinky!

39:36.248 --> 39:37.888
Get out there now.

39:38.368 --> 39:39.928
If you don't finish that wine

39:39.928 --> 39:41.127
and get it right today,

39:41.527 --> 39:43.448
you'll see if I don't come after you.

39:43.567 --> 39:44.448
Alright.

39:44.448 --> 39:45.567
Stop crying. Here, come on.

39:45.567 --> 39:46.448
Are you going or not?

39:47.047 --> 39:48.328
If you stop crying, I'll go.

39:53.647 --> 39:54.207
Fine.

39:55.047 --> 39:55.888
I'll drink.

40:09.808 --> 40:10.968
Drinking is forbidden in the army.

40:10.968 --> 40:11.968
I got this for you.

40:12.127 --> 40:13.288
I know you're not feeling good inside.

40:13.928 --> 40:14.487
Have a drink.

40:15.288 --> 40:16.527
Don't tell Zhao Ling.

40:17.127 --> 40:18.328
Who do you think I am?

40:18.607 --> 40:20.448
Lu Dahu was a bully.

40:20.448 --> 40:21.647
He was never a good man.

40:22.047 --> 40:23.328
But the military merits under his name

40:23.328 --> 40:24.368
are valuable.

40:24.368 --> 40:25.848
Thirty-six heads.

40:26.007 --> 40:27.768
Most soldiers serve their whole lives

40:27.768 --> 40:28.728
and never earn that many.

40:31.768 --> 40:32.888
He's dead.

40:32.888 --> 40:33.808
His military registration is void.

40:33.808 --> 40:35.368
But those merits would just go to waste.

40:35.888 --> 40:37.567
But what if we transferred those merits

40:37.567 --> 40:39.207
to your brothers' names?

40:40.487 --> 40:42.487
You are a banner commander
under Commander Zhao.

40:42.487 --> 40:43.288
As long as you claim them,

40:43.487 --> 40:45.288
those merits belong to your brothers.

40:45.848 --> 40:48.248
Commander Zhao
could leap to the fifth rank

40:48.248 --> 40:49.288
and return to the capital in glory.

40:49.288 --> 40:50.928
And you'd get promoted
right along with him.

40:50.928 --> 40:51.487
Nonsense.

40:52.408 --> 40:53.527
That's fraud.

40:54.687 --> 40:56.687
Plenty of people in the army
have done this already.

40:57.127 --> 40:59.408
Once Commander Zhao
is transferred back to the capital,

40:59.607 --> 41:00.647
no one will ever

41:00.647 --> 41:02.127
come looking into this business
in Ganlin Town.

41:02.127 --> 41:02.527
Get lost.

41:06.196 --> 41:07.310
Commander Zhao.

41:08.636 --> 41:13.969
(Noodles)

41:14.888 --> 41:15.768
Banner Commander Yang.

41:16.968 --> 41:17.647
Go on about your business.

41:22.687 --> 41:24.007
How wonderful.

41:24.127 --> 41:25.007
My son

41:25.127 --> 41:27.928
is a proper sixth-rank official now.

41:28.167 --> 41:29.527
Monthly grain supplies,

41:29.527 --> 41:30.968
yearly pay and provisions,

41:31.248 --> 41:33.288
steady and honorable.

41:33.687 --> 41:34.928
It's a pity, though,

41:34.928 --> 41:35.487
I

41:36.007 --> 41:36.968
cannot see

41:37.408 --> 41:39.408
you in your military uniform.

41:40.127 --> 41:40.607
Mother.

41:42.808 --> 41:43.487
Feel it.

41:43.808 --> 41:44.567
Can you feel it?

41:44.567 --> 41:45.408
I can.

41:45.888 --> 41:46.768
When

41:46.768 --> 41:47.687
I meet

41:47.687 --> 41:49.007
your father

41:49.007 --> 41:50.248
in the afterlife,

41:50.567 --> 41:51.368
I'll be able

41:51.368 --> 41:52.808
to hold my head up high.

41:53.127 --> 41:54.167
Darling,

41:55.087 --> 41:56.527
Yucheng

41:57.007 --> 41:58.768
is a general now.

41:59.007 --> 42:01.647
See how well I've raised him.

42:02.127 --> 42:02.607
Mother.

42:05.567 --> 42:06.047
Mother.

42:07.808 --> 42:08.487
I

42:10.607 --> 42:11.368
will work hard

42:13.487 --> 42:14.288
and earn more military merits.

42:14.607 --> 42:15.647
I'll make sure

42:15.647 --> 42:16.768
you have good food at every meal.

42:17.968 --> 42:19.408
When the time comes, just like Mr. Zhao,

42:19.647 --> 42:20.808
I'll get you

42:20.808 --> 42:21.848
a three-courtyard house.

42:24.567 --> 42:26.527
When you earn more merits,

42:26.888 --> 42:28.328
it'll be time for you

42:28.968 --> 42:30.207
to buy me a grave plot.

42:33.248 --> 42:34.687
What are you saying?

42:35.968 --> 42:37.328
You'll live a long, happy life.

42:38.687 --> 42:39.328
Dig in.

42:40.127 --> 42:40.448
Here.

42:48.687 --> 42:49.527
I have come

42:50.487 --> 42:52.007
to apologize.

42:55.888 --> 42:57.047
That day, I offended you

42:57.288 --> 42:58.408
because Lu Dahu

42:58.408 --> 42:59.527
stole our military merits.

43:00.047 --> 43:01.567
I was filled with resentment,

43:02.087 --> 43:03.607
and that's why I talked back.

43:04.607 --> 43:05.408
I hope

43:07.087 --> 43:08.607
you will not hold it against me.

43:10.248 --> 43:11.647
Is what you say true?

43:12.968 --> 43:13.607
Of course.

43:15.207 --> 43:16.968
Those thirty-six Wangur heads

43:21.127 --> 43:22.207
were earned by the brothers

43:22.647 --> 43:24.007
with their very lives.

43:24.567 --> 43:25.368
Lu Dahu

43:25.368 --> 43:26.728
used his rank to crush us.

43:26.728 --> 43:28.007
He took those merits by force.

43:28.487 --> 43:29.167
The soldiers

43:29.288 --> 43:30.808
were all too afraid to speak up.

43:30.808 --> 43:32.487
Now that Lu Dahu is dead,

43:32.487 --> 43:33.808
I beg you to look into this.

43:33.968 --> 43:34.728
I hope

43:34.968 --> 43:36.207
you will return those merits

43:36.207 --> 43:37.408
to the brothers.

43:37.487 --> 43:38.328
I

43:40.047 --> 43:40.888
bow in gratitude.

43:51.728 --> 43:52.328
Mr. Zhao.

43:53.288 --> 43:54.328
What are you doing here?

43:57.368 --> 43:58.087
Yucheng.

43:58.968 --> 44:00.408
Why did you falsify the records?

44:01.968 --> 44:03.207
Why did you claim Lu Dahu's merits

44:03.567 --> 44:04.928
under the brothers' names?

44:09.408 --> 44:11.127
Yucheng, why did you do this?

44:18.283 --> 44:20.716
(Next Episode)

44:20.888 --> 44:22.567
(Official Document)
Commander Zhao has been arrested.

44:23.007 --> 44:24.007
Someone reported him

44:24.007 --> 44:25.207
for killing civilians
and claiming military credit.

44:25.408 --> 44:26.207
That is a crime

44:26.207 --> 44:27.888
punishable by death.

44:28.087 --> 44:29.127
(Yu Jingxiu!)

44:29.448 --> 44:30.527
(To go after me,)

44:30.728 --> 44:31.808
(you disregard the external threat.)

44:31.808 --> 44:33.567
(The Wangur attack on the pass
is a matter of national security.)

44:34.368 --> 44:36.127
(Aren't you afraid of delaying
critical military actions?)

44:38.408 --> 44:39.808
But a major battle is imminent.

44:40.047 --> 44:41.288
If Ganlin falls,

44:41.848 --> 44:44.127
it will descend into chaos instantly.

44:44.728 --> 44:45.768
Come back to the capital with me.

44:47.328 --> 44:48.368
(Shameless.)

45:02.200 --> 45:06.520
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

45:10.120 --> 45:14.480
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

45:16.600 --> 45:21.240
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

45:21.480 --> 45:24.280
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

45:25.440 --> 45:30.080
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

45:33.280 --> 45:40.120
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

45:41.000 --> 45:47.520
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

45:48.480 --> 45:51.920
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

45:52.440 --> 45:56.640
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

45:56.920 --> 46:02.600
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

46:14.720 --> 46:18.600
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

46:22.520 --> 46:26.520
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

46:28.240 --> 46:32.920
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

46:33.240 --> 46:35.920
♪Kept close within my heart♪

46:37.000 --> 46:41.840
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

46:45.360 --> 46:52.280
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

46:53.160 --> 46:59.640
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

47:00.520 --> 47:04.040
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

47:04.480 --> 47:08.840
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

47:09.040 --> 47:14.760
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
